/* 原版 NPC 日常关系线扩展 / 罗宾·伊甸·雷恩·布莱尔·艾弗里·黑狼 / 6 人 × 3 段 + 1 个入口 hub = 19 passages */
/* 只做日常、关系、小礼物与跑腿，不写大主线，不含露骨内容，失败不扣存款 */

:: MP Daily Extra Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
高街旧书摊侧面的小木架第二层挂着六枚不同质地的信物签：一枚画着笑脸的纸杯垫、一片带松脂香的干冷杉叶、一枚磨平字迹的铜筹码、一条暗红丝绒细带、一张印着烫金花体的便笺，以及一截绑着灰狼毛的皮绳。每样东西都对应着一个熟识的去处，按地点、时辰与往来交情随时可以过去看看。
街角的风吹动皮绳与丝绒带，你把六枚信物签理顺，挑定了今天想走一趟的方向。
<br><br>
<<link [[去孤儿院找罗宾 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[去林间木屋找伊甸 (0:05)|MP Daily Eden 1]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[去旧港栈桥找雷恩 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[去后台找布莱尔 (0:04)|MP Daily Briar 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[去多瑙河街找艾弗里 (0:04)|MP Daily Avery 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[去密林石台找黑狼 (0:05)|MP Daily BlackWolf 1]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<link [[查看木架第一层纸条 (0:02)|MP Daily Life Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[收好信物回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

/* ==================== 1. Robin (罗宾) ==================== */

:: MP Daily Robin 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>>
孤儿院走廊尽头的木桌旁，罗宾正把铁皮零钱盒里的硬币一枚枚倒在绒布上，鼻尖上沾了一点可可粉。周末摆摊剩下的纸杯受了潮，最底下几只粘在了一起，他一边数着一便士和两便士的铜板，一边小声叹气——昨天收摊时太匆忙，账本上的杯数比手头的零钱少了整整两先令。
听见你的脚步声，罗宾立刻抬起头露出温和的笑意，把半块还温着的黄油饼干推到你手边：「你来得正好，我正算不明白这几摞纸杯呢。」
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[帮他核对零钱与纸杯 (0:06)|MP Daily Robin 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 1)>><<pass 6>>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_robin_1")>><<money 150>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin trust 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[帮他烘开受潮纸杯 (0:05)|MP Daily Robin 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 1)>><<pass 5>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[坐桌边陪他吃饼干 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 1)>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>

:: MP Daily Robin 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
到了高街杂货店门外，罗宾把折叠手推车停在台阶旁，手里拿着一张写满肉桂棒、方糖与淡奶的采购单。杂货店门口正卸着大袋面粉，过道窄得只容一人侧身通过，几个顽皮的街童围在手推车边好奇地拨弄车轮上的小铜铃。
罗宾有些局促地护住车斗里的保温壶，既怕撞着店里的搬运工，又怕手推车滑下石阶。
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[帮他扛出淡奶与方糖 (0:06)|MP Daily Robin 3]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 2)>><<pass 6>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 0) gte 7000>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_robin_2")>><<money 200>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin trust 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[替他看推车哄走街童 (0:05)|MP Daily Robin 3]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 2)>><<pass 5>>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 250>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[与他并肩推车回去 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 3]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 2)>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>

:: MP Daily Robin 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">><<effects>>
回到孤儿院房间时，窗外已经染上了浅紫色的暮霭。罗宾在小炉上煮开第一壶加了新肉桂棒的热可可，浓郁的甜香很快填满了狭小的房间。他小心翼翼地盛出最上面飘着奶沫的一杯递给你，又从清洗干净的帆布袋夹层里摸出了昨天漏算的那枚两先令银币。
「原来卡在袋角缝线里了！」罗宾如释重负地弯起眼睛，把银币旁边多出的几枚零钱硬塞进你掌心，说是今天请你的跑腿茶钱。
<br><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[帮他调糖霜收账册 (0:05)|MP Daily Extra Hub]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to 3>><<pass 5>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
		<<stress -3>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_robin_3")>><<money 200>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin trust 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[喝热可可听他聊趣事 (0:05)|MP Daily Extra Hub]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to 3>><<pass 5>><<stress -3>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[道别后回孤儿院走廊 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<set $mpDailyRobin to 3>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

/* ==================== 2. Eden (伊甸) ==================== */

:: MP Daily Eden 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
森林木屋的屋檐下堆着半人高的冷杉圆木，空气里飘着松脂与熏肉的浓郁气味。伊甸单手拎着沉重的宽刃劈柴斧，正将一段湿木桩架上树墩；旁边的烟熏木架下火苗有些发暗，几挂风干的鹿肉条需要添入新的干果木枝。
瞥见你走近木屋，伊甸停下斧头，用下巴指了指脚边的竹篓：「既然来了就别闲着，要么把碎木抱进棚里，要么看着熏架别让火灭了。」
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[拿副斧帮他劈干松木 (0:07)|MP Daily Eden 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyEden to Math.max(($mpDailyEden or 0), 1)>><<pass 7>>
	<<if ($physique or 0) gte 7800>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_eden_1")>><<money 200>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[往熏架添果木稳火候 (0:06)|MP Daily Eden 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyEden to Math.max(($mpDailyEden or 0), 1)>><<pass 6>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[把柴火码齐在屋檐下 (0:05)|MP Daily Eden 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyEden to Math.max(($mpDailyEden or 0), 1)>><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>

:: MP Daily Eden 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
午后的密林小径覆着厚厚的落叶，伊甸背着猎步枪走在前面，带你巡查溪流北岸的几处防兽绳套。在一处桦木林拐角，原本用来标记安全浅滩的刻痕界石被山洪冲歪进了泥坑，而灌木丛下的钢丝绳套也被野猪拱乱了机关簧片。
林间雾气渐起，伊甸蹲下身按住草丛，示意你跟紧他的脚步。
<br><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[用猎刀重设绳套机关 (0:06)|MP Daily Eden 3]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyEden to Math.max(($mpDailyEden or 0), 2)>><<pass 6>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
		<<stress -2>>
