/* ==================== 4. Briar (布莱尔) ==================== */

:: MP Daily Briar 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
午后的后台化装廊难得一片安静，只有丝绒帷幔间飘着淡淡的琥珀香水味。布莱尔正站在长桌前，用镊子挑拣一盒彩色琉璃灯罩片——昨晚二楼包厢的一盏壁灯被醉客碰歪，琥珀色与深紫色的灯片混在了一起，要是不在晚场开演前配齐，走廊的灯光就会露白。
听见动静，布莱尔侧过身上下打量了你一眼，嘴角噙着一抹意味深长的笑：「眼神还算清醒的话，过来帮我把这两副灯罩配成对。」
<br><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[按色泽配齐琉璃灯片 (0:06)|MP Daily Briar 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyBriar to Math.max(($mpDailyBriar or 0), 1)>><<pass 6>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_briar_1")>><<money 200>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>><<npcincr Briar trust 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[顺话头点评包厢灯光 (0:05)|MP Daily Briar 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyBriar to Math.max(($mpDailyBriar or 0), 1)>><<pass 5>>
	<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>><<npcincr Briar love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[把铜灯架摆回原位 (0:04)|MP Daily Briar 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyBriar to Math.max(($mpDailyBriar or 0), 1)>><<pass 4>><<stress -1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>><<npcincr Briar trust 1>><</if>>
<</link>>

:: MP Daily Briar 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
配好灯罩后，布莱尔把一张盖有紫火漆的取货凭条交给高街精品店，让你替他取回一把刚换好扇骨的银柄羽毛折扇与两卷金丝绒带。然而精品店伙计却在账册前犯了难：另外一位多瑙河街的管家也想加价买走那两卷金丝绒带，正等在柜台旁。
你在柜台镜面里看到那位管家手里的礼盒尺码其实只需要窄边银带，根本用不上宽幅金丝绒。
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[劝管家改选窄银丝带 (0:06)|MP Daily Briar 3]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyBriar to Math.max(($mpDailyBriar or 0), 2)>><<pass 6>>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 270 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 270>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_briar_2")>><<money 250>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>><<npcincr Briar trust 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 4>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
